# Pretty-URL redirects (Pages also does .html → extensionless natively;
# these keep behavior explicit under Git deploys and cover edge cases).
#
# Static rules first: a greedy /*.html splat would wrongly map
# /index.html → /index instead of /.
#
# ASCII slug migration for umlaut business pages (NFC + NFD + .html).
# Use percent-encoded sources so NFC (%C3%B6 / %C3%A4) and NFD (%CC%88)
# stay distinct; Pages normalizes literal Unicode to the same encodings.
/business/h%C3%B6rmann-innovative-door-systems /business/hormann-innovative-door-systems 308
/business/h%C3%B6rmann-innovative-door-systems.html /business/hormann-innovative-door-systems 308
